  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **(We Belong Together)**: back after 41 archived shows (1072 days) [2]\n- **(hi, we're the Mountain Goats)**: back after 41 archived shows (1072 days) [2]\n- **The Destruction of the Kola Superdeep Borehole Tower**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Picture of My Dress**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **The New Hydra Collection**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Alphabetizing**: back after 33 archived shows (841 days); rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Fall of the Star High School Running Back**: back after 52 archived shows (1258 days) [2]\n- **Tollund Man**: back after 161 archived shows (4437 days) [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: The Slow Parts on Death Metal Albums, Dark in Here [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2021-08-07** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 86 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Uploader urges concertgoers during the pandemic to get vaccinated and keep masking to protect musicians, venue staff, crew and other attendees [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2021-08-07**: taped by Liz Hamilton; transferred by Liz Hamilton [1]",
